n=\"top\" width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#F5EEEE\" style=\"background:#F5EEEE;border-top:3px solid #8C2926;padding:18px 20px 4px 20px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C2926;\">Know this</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#2B2B2B;\">In California, nonexempt employees get a 30-minute meal break before the end of their fifth hour of work, plus a paid 10-minute rest break for every four hours. Rest breaks have to be truly off duty. Miss one and the company owes an extra hour of pay for each day it happens. When the calendar fills up, breaks are usually the first thing to slip. Protect them.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:24px 40px 0 40px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"border:2px solid #8C2926;padding:22px 24px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C2926;\">Your 5-minute move</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#2B2B2B;\">Before the end of the month, grab 5 minutes with each person on your team and ask three questions: Are you clear on your priorities? Is anything blocking you, or is there something we should stop doing? How can I help?</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:26px 40px 34px 40px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2B2B;\">Questions, or something with your team you want to talk through? Reach out to Ben anytime at <a href=\"mailto:ben@presidiobay.com\" style=\"color:#8C2926;font-weight:bold;\">ben@presidiobay.com</a>.<br><br><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#707070;\">Sources: <a href=\"https://www.taylorfrancis.com/chapters/mono/10.4324/9780080549354-5/first-things-first-peter-drucker\" style=\"color:#707070;\">Drucker</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.gallup.com/workplace/654911/employee-engagement-sinks-year-low.aspx\" style=\"color:#707070;\">Gallup</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.dir.ca.gov/dlse/faq_mealperiods.htm\" style=\"color:#707070;\">Cal. DIR: meal periods</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://www.dir.ca.gov/dlse/faq_restperiods.htm\" style=\"color:#707070;\">Cal. DIR: rest periods</a></span></td></tr><!--/BODY-->\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>", "status": "ready", "inLibrary": false, "label": "Presidio Bay & The Main Post", "createdAt": "2026-10-26T20:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-10-26T20:00:00Z"}$nl$::jsonb || jsonb_build_object('clientId', cid))
